      "message": "test(app): name app::posting_plasma in plasma_gate's gate map\n\nThe quick gate's plan read `app::posting_plasma -> 0 suite(s)`; the\nsuite header now names the module (and app::machine::plasma), so a\nchange to the plasma clause picks its own suite.\n\nRefs #672\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
